{"pagination":{"maxPageableSet":"10000","numFound":1,"query":"name=Dennett&limit=10&title=From Bacteria to Bach and Back","limit":10,"start":0},"items":{"mods":{"titleInfo":{"title":"From bacteria to Bach and back","subTitle":"the evolution of minds"},"name":{"@nameTitleGroup":"1","@usage":"primary","@type":"personal","namePart":"Dennett, D. C. (Daniel Clement)","role":[{"roleTerm":{"@type":"text","#text":"creator"}},{"roleTerm":{"@type":"text","#text":"author."}}]},"typeOfResource":"text","genre":[{"@authority":"marcgt","#text":"bibliography"},{"@authority":"rdacontent","#text":"text"}],"originInfo":[{"place":{"placeTerm":[{"@type":"code","@authority":"marccountry","#text":"nyu"},{"@type":"text","@authority":"marccountry","#text":"New York (State)"}]},"dateIssued":{"@encoding":"marc","#text":"2017"},"edition":"First Edition.","issuance":"monographic"},{"@eventType":"publication","place":{"placeTerm":{"@type":"text","#text":"New York :"}},"publisher":"W.W. Norton & Company,","dateIssued":[2017]}],"language":{"languageTerm":[{"@type":"code","@authority":"iso639-2b","#text":"eng"},{"@type":"text","@authority":"iso639-2b","#text":"English"}]},"physicalDescription":{"form":[{"@authority":"marcform","#text":"print"},{"@type":"media","@authority":"rdamedia","#text":"unmediated"},{"@type":"carrier","@authority":"rdacarrier","#text":"volume"}],"extent":"xviii, 476 pages, 2 unnumbered pages of plates : illustrations (some color) ; 25 cm"},"abstract":{"@type":"Summary","#text":"A leading philosopher offers a major new account of the origins of the conscious mind that explores the deep interactions of evolution, brains, and human culture, demonstrating the role of culture in installing memes, including language, in the mind."},"tableOfContents":"Turning our world upside down. Introduction ; Before bacteria and Bach ; On the origin of reasons ; Two strange inversions of reasoning ; The evolution of understanding -- From evolution to intelligent design. What is information? ; Da